<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<section data-terminal-demo="macos-terminal" data-terminal-instance="export-macos-terminal-default" aria-label="macOS 터미널 샘플 미리보기" data-klic-component="macos-terminal" class="kn-macos-terminal"><div data-mcp-terminal-shell data-part="hs-terminal"><div data-part="hs-terminal-top"><span aria-hidden="true" data-part="hs-window-lights"><i data-part="icon"></i><i data-part="icon"></i><i data-part="icon"></i></span><small data-part="hs-terminal-path"><i data-lucide="folder" aria-hidden="true" data-part="icon"></i><span>~/KLIC</span></small><button type="button" data-hs-copy data-mcp-terminal-copy aria-label="연결 설정 복사" data-part="btn"><i data-lucide="copy" aria-hidden="true" data-part="icon"></i> 복사</button></div><div role="group" aria-label="개발 도구 선택" data-part="hs-client-tabs"><button type="button" data-hs-client="Codex" data-mcp-terminal-client="Codex" aria-pressed="true" data-part="btn">Codex</button><button type="button" data-hs-client="Claude" data-mcp-terminal-client="Claude" aria-pressed="false" data-part="btn">Claude</button><button type="button" data-hs-client="Cursor" data-mcp-terminal-client="Cursor" aria-pressed="false" data-part="btn">Cursor</button><button type="button" data-hs-client="CLI" data-mcp-terminal-client="CLI" aria-pressed="false" data-part="btn">CLI</button><button type="button" data-hs-client="API" data-mcp-terminal-client="API" aria-pressed="false" data-part="btn">API</button></div><pre><code data-hs-code data-mcp-terminal-code>codex mcp add klic --url https://design.klic.co.kr/api/v1/mcp</code></pre><div data-part="hs-terminal-foot"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span><p data-hs-client-note>외부 클라이언트용 공개 읽기 전용 MCP입니다. ChatGPT·Claude 조직 연결은 /connect에서 설정하세요. ChatGPT Sites 플러그인은 Sites 인증을 사용하는 별도 경로입니다.</p></div><a href="#docs/integrations" data-part="link">연동 문서에서 자세히 보기 <i data-lucide="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" data-part="icon"></i></a><a href="/connect" data-part="link">조직 연결 안내 <i data-lucide="arrow-right" aria-hidden="true" data-part="icon"></i></a></div></section>
